    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon</em></p><p>This magic satchel has 3 charges and regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. As a Magic action, you can expend 1 charge and pull its drawstring tight to lay a silencing hex on a creature you can see within 60 feet of yourself. The target must succeed on a DC 15 Charisma saving throw or be cursed for 1 minute. While cursed, its mouth is sealed shut: it can’t cast spells with a Verbal component, drink potions, or eat or drink anything. The target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on itself on a success.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-EbseoYk7ZCqM1KMn\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>La cible refait le jet de Charisme DD 15 à la fin de chacun de ses tours : retirez l’effet sur une réussite.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
